"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Naming (ADR-0010): helpers are named after the Origami ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"patch"}]},{"text":", bare (no prefix) —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"disambiguate with the module (","type":"text"},{"code":"OrigamiPatterns.Interaction","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") if it ever collides. This one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"doesn’t clash with anything in SwiftUI.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Exposes the Interaction patch’s output ports as bindings\/callbacks so downstream SwiftUI","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"composes off them, matching the graph:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"down"},{"type":"text","text":" — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" while a finger is on the layer,"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"position"},{"type":"text","text":" — the touch point, in the layer’s coordinate space,"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onTap"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onDoubleTap"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onLongPress"},{"type":"text","text":" — discrete pulses."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Only the gesture for an output you actually request is attached — so a tap-only layer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"carries only a tap recognizer (no stray drag), which keeps gesture arbitration clean.","type":"text"}]}]}],"references":{"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"url":"\/documentation\/swami","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami